<title>BELGIUM: Hoogovens, Boel seen signing deal Friday.</title>
<headline>Hoogovens, Boel seen signing deal Friday.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch steel maker Hoogovens and private Belgian steel maker Usines Gustave Boel said on Friday they would hold a news conference on Friday at 1400 local (1300 GMT).</p>
<p>Belgian radio speculated the companies were to announce the signature of their long-planned three billion Belgian franc link-up. Under the merger plan Hoogovens will take a 50 percent stake in the Belgian company.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Boel declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
